04 on this route. Ann's own cell also allows 404/409; the scenario shown confirms 404 for a check-in under a different habit or one already deleted, and 409 `habit_archived` for an archived habit.\",\"citations\":[{\"target\":\"rule:R82\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"answers 204 and sets the check-in's `deleted_at`\"},{\"target\":\"rule:R28\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"A habit, check-in, nudge or device of another user answers 404 with code `not_found` on every route\"},{\"target\":\"cell:ben|DELETE /v1/habits/{}/completions/{}\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"404\"},{\"target\":\"cell:ann|DELETE /v1/habits/{}/completions/{}\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"204/404/409\"},{\"target\":\"impl:route:DELETE /v1/habits/{}/completions/{}\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"implemented_unverified\"}],\"implementation\":\"implemented_unverified\",\"implementation_basis\":\"static\"}","ttft_ms":5341,"type":"result","duration_ms":7877,"uuid":"a89e989e-cf88-4272-81df-7347e73963bc","ttft_stream_ms":1662,"time_to_request_ms":18,"first_content_frame_ms":1662,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
